2) Visit classes in order: container then rock. Do not skip order.
3) Use occupancy '.' cells for exploration if target class not detected.
4) After each stop at a target class, require confirm_stop(class_name) from lidar or camera. Do not proceed until confirm_stop returns true.
5) Report mission done only after both container and rock have confirm_stop=true.

